      {
        "id": "dynamic-build-code",
        "moduleId": "dynamic-list",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "教材例 9.9：creat 函数的建链流程",
        "markdown": "教材定义 3 个指针变量 `head`、`p1`、`p2`，都用来指向 struct Student 类型数据。`p1` 指向新开辟的结点，`p2` 指向链表中最后一个结点，用 `p2->next = p1` 把新结点连到表尾；`n` 记录结点个数。\n\n```c\n#define LEN sizeof(struct Student)\nstruct Student * creat(void)\n{ struct Student * head, * p1, * p2;\n  n = 0;\n  p1 = p2 = (struct Student *) malloc(LEN);\n  scanf(\"%ld,%f\", &p1->num, &p1->score);\n  head = NULL;\n  while (p1->num != 0)\n  { n = n + 1;\n    if (n == 1) head = p1;\n    else p2->next = p1;\n    p2 = p1;\n    p1 = (struct Student *) malloc(LEN);\n    scanf(\"%ld,%f\", &p1->num, &p1->score);\n  }\n  p2->next = NULL;\n  return head;\n}\n```\n\n`LEN` 代表 struct Student 类型数据的长度；`malloc(LEN)` 开辟一个长度为 LEN 的内存区，带回的是不指向任何类型的 `void *` 指针，前面的 `(struct Student *)` 把它转换为指向 struct Student 数据的指针。函数最后返回 `head`，即链表第 1 个结点的起始地址，调用者据此才能访问整条链表。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
